   "sid": "s18",
   "added": "2026-11-10"
  },
  {
   "text": "of what is possible, from Super Intelligence to space exploration, and helping secure our nation's competitive advantage in the technologies that will define our future",
   "date": "2026-10-08",
   "date_quote": "2026-10-08T19:06:42.000Z",
   "context": "Verified direct statement by Jared Isaacman. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
