   "added": "2026-11-10"
  },
  {
   "text": "years ahead as advances in AI, quantum technologies, additive manufacturing, and robotics unleash possibilities once barely imaginable.\n\nWe should be building the talent pipeline now",
   "date": "2026-09-05",
   "date_quote": "2026-09-05T18:23:10.000Z",
   "context": "Verified direct statement by Jared Isaacman. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
