   "sid": "s24",
   "added": "2026-11-10"
  },
  {
   "text": "is proud to join President Trump’s Genesis Mission, using AI to accelerate discovery and advance American leadership in space.\n\nThank you for your leadership @mkratsios47!",
   "date": "2026-07-22",
   "date_quote": "2026-07-22T15:09:37.000Z",
